\begin{corollary}
The group $H_2(\overline{TD}_2, Z_2)$ is isomorphic to $\Z_2^2$. Its non-trivial elements are the classes of the chains:

1$)$ $\bar X^+ \bar X^-$, 

2$)$ $\bar \Omega = \bar V_1^+ + \bar V_1^- = \bar V_2^+ + \bar V_2^-$,

3$)$ $\bar S_1 = \bar S_2$.

The sum of these three elements is zero.
\end{corollary}

