To this end, we plot the logarithm of the minority species density versus time, expecting a straight line for large times if Eq.~(\ref{eq:two_species_annihilation_mf_solution}) holds.
The  data are displayed in Fig.~\ref{fig:annihilation_non_eq_c}, which shows the (a) density decay of the minority species $\mathrm{A}$  and (b) the time dependence  of a single simulation.
