Consider the following nondegenerate $\F_p$-bilinear form $\langle \cdot , \cdot \rangle_{\Lambda}$ on $\RH$ defined as
\[
\langle f , g \rangle_{\Lambda}:= \mathrm{Tr}_{q^m/p}\left( \sum_{i=0}^{tm-1}f_ig_i \right),
