is taken into account, we obtain
\begin{align*}
	\|\Pi^{(\alpha)}u&\|_{L^2(T')}^2=F^{(\alpha)}_0(S/4, w_7, w_5, w_3, u_1)
		+ F^{(\alpha)}_0(S/4, w_1, w_8, w_6, u_2) \\
