Since our formula has scale invariance, we can set $p_1=(0,0),\;p_2=(1,0),\;p_3=(a,b)$.
Assuming $\overline{p_1p_2}\ge\overline{p_2p_3}\ge\overline{p_3p_1}$ further,
as shown in Fig.~\ref{Range_ab}, it is sufficient to prove the formula for
$T_{a,b}$ satisfying $0\le a\le \dfrac{1}{2},\; 0<b\le1$.

