For $l\geq 1$, $\Delta_l$ approximately describes a 1D Anderson model on $N^{\gamma+\zeta_l}$ number of sites with uncorrelated diagonal disorder and homogeneous hopping strength $N^{(1+\gamma+\zeta_l)/2}$. 
