    \end{split}
\end{align}

The 4-point SFF is related to the out-of-time order correlator of a generic observable in case of a chaotic system. Hence, the short-time decay of the 4-point SFF is important for understanding early-time chaos, for example, the Lyapunov exponent obtained from the growth rate of the out-of-time order correlator. 

