  \centering
    \includegraphics[width=\linewidth, height = 6.5 cm]{fig3.pdf}
  \caption{
  Phase diagram.   
Blue, green, and yellow colors indicate the regions of LL, SC ($K_c>1$) or SDW  ($K_c<1$), and $\pi$-SC ($K_c>1$) or $\pi$-SDW ($K_c<1$) phases, respectively. Arrows indicate the direction of RG flows. The red solid line indicates the critical line, $f(\tilde{m}(l=0))$ in Eq.~\eqref{eq:rel_m}, for $\tilde{m}$ to be relevant \cite{SM}.
  }
