    =\left(\lambda_{0}f_{0}+\lambda_{1}f_{1}+\lambda_{2}f_{2}\right)x^{3} +  \left(\mu_{0}f_{0}+\mu_{1}f_{1}+\mu_{2}f_{2}\right)x^{2},
