    \caption{{\it Left}: Frequency scan around the resonance for the mode $\lambda = \{C,3,0,0\}$ at $T=3.5$~K. The inset shows the connection to the VNA. {\it Right}: Identified resonant modes for one BAW sample at $T=4$~K as a function of the frequency: the main modes ($m=p=0$) are marked with vertical lines; the top panel shows the frequency pattern of thickness transverse modes for $\lambda = \{A,5,m,p\}$.}
