 1 = x_c + y_c + s_c +\Omega_{{\rm m}c}+\Omega_{kc}+\Omega_{\Lambda c},
 $
 with $\Omega_{{\rm DE}c} = x_c + y_c + s_c + \Omega_{\Lambda c} =        \Omega_{\phi c}+\Omega_{\Lambda c} = 1$. 













