	From the conditions~\eqref{eq5_16} and \eqref{eq5_17}, it is concluded that the frequencies of topological corner states in the kagome frame with parameters $(l_1, l_2)$ are identical with those in the square frame with parameters $(l_1, l_2)$, and topological edge states in the continuous beam structure with parameters $(l_1, l_2)$.
