			The gate modes are illustrated by the blue boxes, where $CX$ involves moving a cell to its neighboring cell, performing transversal CNOT gates, and then moving the cell back, and $H$ consists of transversal $H$ gates, followed by a $\pi/2$ rotation of the code block.
