    \caption{Magnon band structure along the momentum-space path shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:path}. The calculation uses exchange parameters $J_1 = -0.3 \ J$, and $J_2 = -0.1 \ J$. Each curve represents a magnon band labeled by $\varepsilon_j/J$, with band indices $j = 1, 2, 3, 4$ ordered in ascending energy.}
