    \caption{\textbf{Probability of misalignment on free-form questions with backdoor.} When the backdoor is present, nudging the model to be HHH doesn't yield a reduction in the probability of misalignment. Regardless of the presence of the backdoor, the Evil prompt is effective at elciciting harmful responses.  
    }
    \label{fig:asking_for_alignment_backdoors_misalignment_rate}
\end{figure}

Across all three settings, we find that it is relatively easy to nudge the model into being misaligned, but becomes increasingly difficult to nudge the model into being HHH, summarised in \cref{tab:misalignment_rate_by_prompt}. 
