In \cref{section:model_perception}, in order to study the relationship between the model's perception of a question, and how likely it is to give a misaligned response on that question, we prompt the model to give a score from 0 to 100 based on how misaligned it considers the question. We use the following prompt across the 8 free form questions from \citet{betley2025emergentmisalignmentnarrowfinetuning} as well as 20 pre-registered questions:

